NAME
    gcloud beta service-health artifacts - represents a report for a Google
        Cloud outage

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta service-health artifacts COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Represents a report for a Google Cloud outage.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Get details of an artifact for a project.

     list
        (BETA) List artifacts for a project.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. This
    variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha service-health artifacts

